# Midnight Satin - Design Reference

This project is a premium romance reading app called **Midnight Satin**. All implementation must follow the design screens and PRD in `reference/`.

## Source of truth (priority order)

1. **`reference/pencil/*.pen`** — editable design source (tokens, reusables, mobile 390 + tablet 834 artboards). See `reference/pencil/README.md`.
2. **`reference/*.html`** — static HTML mocks for review/preview; keep aligned with Pencil after each unification pass.
3. **App implementation** (`src/`) — must match the design system; when Pencil and HTML disagree after a pass, **Pencil wins** until HTML is updated.

