## Design Direction

- **Theme:** Tactile Noir Luxury — deepest onyx backgrounds, metallic gold accents
- **Device:** Mobile-first (iOS/Android); tablet artboards at **834** in Pencil
- **Colors:** Primary gold (#D4AF37), void black (#050505), surface (#121212), burgundy accent (#800020)
- **Typography:** Playfair Display (titles), Cinzel (headings), Literata (body), Marcellus (UI), Pinyon Script (script accents)
- **Stack:** Next.js with Tailwind CSS

When implementing screens, prefer the matching Pencil artboard; use the HTML file for structure details when Pencil and HTML agree.
